Z||000000||fropuff||10-05-2000||09:09 PM||||Hey, I was wondering if anyone out there has rockcrawl's new side scoop.  I really like the look of it.  I was thinking of getting one for my GT.  I would just get the one for the left side.  I think it looks a little funny on the other side, as the same body lines are not on that side.  I also think they're kinda cheap.  If I got one, I think I would glass it in, as I saw pics on eBay, and I think that would be a welcome mat for vandals.  Do you know how easy it would be to walk up to the side, rip it off, drop it on the ground, and walk away?  I was thinking of glassing it in because I still have some paint left form the paint job in August.  Is anyone else going to glass theirs in?  I don't know if he has sent them, but does anyone have one?  How does it look?  Thanks.||||reg||1
Z||000001||BroCar 87||10-05-2000||10:27 PM||||Well he realll busy, so he only made a few to sell. I believe he only had them out on ebay anyways. Only one person from the forum (that I know of) has purchased one. (from ebay).<BR>He just didn't have the time to acompany all the needs and wants of the sweeet looking scoops. <BR>Last I heard someone was talking to him about making a mold and then mass producing it from there. But HE won't make anymore.<P>I did like the look of those scoops too.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Signature2.jpg"> <BR>87 Coupe "IRON BEAST"<BR>84 SE (project)||||reg||4
